WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 3=

01:11.040 --> 01:12.480
That's a brutal beating.

01:14.240 --> 01:15.760
This is far too heavy.

01:15.760 --> 01:16.880
She won't be able to walk after this.

01:16.880 --> 01:18.200
Look at all this blood.

01:18.600 --> 01:20.080
Will she be beaten to death?

01:22.320 --> 01:23.520
I doubt she'll even survive.

01:23.800 --> 01:24.760
How pitiful.

01:24.840 --> 01:26.880
We must never offend
the Lady of Bright Deportment.

01:29.040 --> 01:31.120
Pay attention, Ladies.

01:31.480 --> 01:32.960
Whether you become a Noble Lady

01:33.320 --> 01:34.800
or a useless cripple

01:35.640 --> 01:37.680
depends entirely on your own choices.

01:38.520 --> 01:39.840
Cut out her tongue.

02:12.040 --> 02:14.520
Are you here to watch
your owner's punishment?

02:15.040 --> 02:16.240
Shen Zhinian is terrified.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.290
She surely won't go
to the Cold Palace tonight.

02:18.920 --> 02:20.360
She will certainly go.

02:23.880 --> 02:26.700
Dowager Consort Liu always thought
Your Ladyship wasn't ruthless enough.

02:26.720 --> 02:28.240
She's making a point to Your Ladyship.

02:28.560 --> 02:30.240
The palace rules dictate flogging.

02:30.320 --> 02:31.640
But she's using illegal torture.

02:32.360 --> 02:34.040
I'm going to take
the palace rules to her

02:34.040 --> 02:35.520
and read them to her one by one.

02:35.600 --> 02:36.990
Please don't be angry, Your Ladyship.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.560
She is a Dowager Consort

02:38.800 --> 02:40.400
and the Emperor's nominal foster mother.

02:40.640 --> 02:41.880
Even His Majesty defers to her.

02:44.840 --> 02:46.640
Your Ladyship,
I've investigated everything.

02:46.700 --> 02:48.630
Someone planted forbidden
flowers in the Cold Palace.

02:48.640 --> 02:49.600
A large patch

02:49.680 --> 02:51.120
has bloomed in the palace.

02:51.320 --> 02:52.480
Clear them out now.

02:52.640 --> 02:53.080
Yes.

02:53.440 --> 02:54.000
Wait.

02:55.320 --> 02:56.400
Use the flowers as bait.

02:56.920 --> 02:58.440
Let's see who actually planted them.

02:59.320 --> 03:00.080
Have men watch it.

03:00.640 --> 03:02.600
If anyone dares to go to
the Cold Palace tonight,

03:02.920 --> 03:04.200
report back at once.

03:04.440 --> 03:05.280
Yes.

03:05.420 --> 03:08.500
(Cold Palace)

03:11.820 --> 03:12.920
It's already the hour of Zi.

03:13.500 --> 03:14.600
Your Majesty guessed wrong.

03:14.960 --> 03:16.080
She won't be coming tonight.

03:23.800 --> 03:25.320
She actually dared to come.

03:25.760 --> 03:27.040
She has some courage

03:27.200 --> 03:28.360
for taking such a risk.

03:29.120 --> 03:30.680
But she doesn't seem to be coming over.

03:31.320 --> 03:33.280
She's heading toward
where Xu Baoqin is held.

03:35.680 --> 03:36.640
You go back first.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.240
Yes.

03:47.440 --> 03:48.200
Don't be afraid.

03:48.640 --> 03:49.920
I'm here to bring you medicine.

03:50.840 --> 03:51.800
I mean no harm.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.600
I will bribe the guards here.

04:08.480 --> 04:09.720
I won't let you go hungry.

04:11.760 --> 04:13.640
It's so dark in the Cold Palace.

04:14.640 --> 04:16.520
I'll leave this lantern for you.

04:17.000 --> 04:18.000
There's nothing more

04:18.360 --> 04:19.480
I can do.

04:24.320 --> 04:25.120
Take care.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.480
She framed you like that.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.400
Why do you still want to save her?

04:44.800 --> 04:45.880
She was wrong.

04:46.200 --> 04:47.500
But to suffer such cruel torture

04:47.760 --> 04:48.840
is simply too much.

04:51.000 --> 04:51.960
In this palace,

04:52.280 --> 04:53.920
there is no room for your kind heart.

04:54.640 --> 04:55.880
I'm no saint.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.600
I'm just an ordinary person.

04:58.200 --> 04:59.480
I can be soft-hearted,

05:00.060 --> 05:01.320
but I also know how to survive.

05:02.200 --> 05:02.920
Your Ladyship,

05:03.040 --> 05:05.240
I saw someone enter
the Cold Palace with my own eyes.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.440
They are inside right now.

05:06.440 --> 05:07.680
It's over. Quick, hide.

05:08.400 --> 05:11.000
I'd like to see
who is desecrating the palace grounds.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.640
Follow me in and seize them.

05:20.160 --> 05:21.640
(That's strange.)

05:22.120 --> 05:23.320
(Ever since I was poisoned,)

05:23.680 --> 05:24.600
(my internal organs)

05:24.600 --> 05:26.290
(have felt like they
were on fire every day.)

05:26.800 --> 05:27.880
(But holding her hand)

05:28.880 --> 05:30.760
(actually makes me
feel quite comfortable.)

05:32.600 --> 05:34.080
(Let's test her one more time.)

05:35.500 --> 05:37.320
Didn't you want to
learn the art of seduction?

05:42.720 --> 05:43.880
I wonder

05:48.880 --> 05:50.600
where you would like to begin.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.640
(What is he up to?)

05:53.000 --> 05:53.560
(Never mind.)

05:53.570 --> 05:54.580
(I'll just go along with it.)

05:55.600 --> 05:58.120
If I'm to learn,
I want to learn something different.

06:00.720 --> 06:01.760
I'll be on top,

06:02.520 --> 06:03.560
and he'll be on the bottom.

06:08.100 --> 06:10.100
♪You do not know♪

06:10.260 --> 06:13.820
♪The partridge's cry
is full of resentment♪

06:14.600 --> 06:16.520
Senior Attendant Shen,
you are quite bold.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.280
Attendant Li, you said it yourself.

06:19.680 --> 06:20.880
If I want to be seductive,

06:21.040 --> 06:22.420
I can't afford to be timid.

06:22.420 --> 06:27.460
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

06:27.860 --> 06:31.540
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

06:31.560 --> 06:33.440
Attendant Li, teach me well.

06:33.880 --> 06:35.160
If you do a good job,

06:35.800 --> 06:37.000
you'll be richly rewarded.

06:37.140 --> 06:40.700
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

06:40.740 --> 06:47.220
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

06:47.540 --> 06:54.180
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

06:57.240 --> 06:59.240
You clearly know
the ways of men and women.

07:00.560 --> 07:02.080
Why do you still need me to teach you?

07:02.480 --> 07:04.400
Attendant Li, don't you know

07:04.960 --> 07:06.360
that if one serves with beauty,

07:07.000 --> 07:08.320
as beauty fades,

07:08.680 --> 07:09.840
love withers,

07:10.280 --> 07:11.360
and when love withers,

07:11.600 --> 07:12.880
favor ends?

07:14.320 --> 07:15.200
What I want

07:15.800 --> 07:17.380
is for the moon to shine only on me.

07:17.380 --> 07:21.260
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

07:23.480 --> 07:25.440
Emperors have been fickle
since ancient times.

07:25.920 --> 07:27.280
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

07:28.120 --> 07:29.960
Then, I'll just have
to settle for his body.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.600
If I can hold the moon
in my arms every night,

07:32.620 --> 07:33.560
that would be nice too.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.680
You have grand ambitions, huh?

07:38.200 --> 07:39.480
A small token of appreciation.

07:39.800 --> 07:40.840
(Ten Taels of Silver)
Please accept this, Attendant.

07:46.120 --> 07:47.040
Ten taels?

07:47.760 --> 07:49.560
You want to control a man's heart

07:50.280 --> 07:51.560
for only ten taels?

07:54.640 --> 07:56.320
A heart that doesn't shine solely on me

07:56.760 --> 07:57.560
isn't worth much.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.800
"Isn't worth much," huh?

08:03.200 --> 08:04.040
Fine.

08:05.040 --> 08:06.640
I will teach you right now.

08:11.960 --> 08:13.360
Why did you bring me here?

08:13.960 --> 08:14.720
To know your enemy

08:15.080 --> 08:16.480
is to be victorious in every battle.

08:17.580 --> 08:18.480
First, learn to drink.

08:18.920 --> 08:19.800
Drink?

08:20.240 --> 08:21.040
Black Zhen Liquor.

08:21.680 --> 08:22.800
It goes down like fire,

08:23.040 --> 08:24.280
burning the heart and soul.

08:25.320 --> 08:26.400
It is his favorite.

08:30.600 --> 08:32.160
Half qian of Nine-Steamed Spring,

08:32.560 --> 08:34.120
one qian of Amber Settle.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.920
Gaze at Thousand-Mountain Moon,

08:36.600 --> 08:38.080
and have the winter snow once more.

08:39.040 --> 08:39.880
Finally,

08:40.240 --> 08:41.760
add a little Zhen poison.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.800
Zhen poison?

08:45.000 --> 08:46.280
Won't I die if I drink it?

08:46.500 --> 08:47.600
You must control the amount.

08:48.160 --> 08:51.400
With the right amount, you'll feel like
you're floating to heaven.

08:51.770 --> 08:52.680
But if it's too much...

08:53.160 --> 08:54.280
I'll die on the spot.

08:56.520 --> 08:57.160
Have a taste.

08:59.360 --> 09:01.080
(It can't be real Zhen poison.)

09:01.360 --> 09:02.800
(One drop of Zhen poison is lethal.)

09:03.200 --> 09:04.520
(If he wanted to kill me,)

09:04.530 --> 09:06.240
(he wouldn't go
through all this trouble.)

09:12.000 --> 09:13.640
If I were serving liquor to His Majesty,

09:14.120 --> 09:15.440
should I feed him like this?

09:18.200 --> 09:19.320
He won't drink it.

09:19.920 --> 09:20.720
Oh.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.720
What about this?

09:58.640 --> 09:59.400
Your Ladyship,

09:59.720 --> 10:01.240
someone broke into the liquor cellar.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.760
Hurry up and catch them.

10:03.190 --> 10:03.960
Yes, Your Ladyship.

10:04.840 --> 10:05.240
Let's go

10:05.520 --> 10:06.000
take a look.

10:07.980 --> 10:13.500
(Bamboo Dew Spring)

10:13.520 --> 10:14.200
Tell me,

10:14.880 --> 10:15.760
who are you?

10:16.290 --> 10:17.560
Why did you come to the palace?

10:19.160 --> 10:20.760
My name is Shen Zhinian.

10:22.160 --> 10:23.600
I entered the palace

10:24.640 --> 10:27.160
to marry the most powerful man

10:28.080 --> 10:30.200
and attain the highest power.

10:31.600 --> 10:33.000
So, it's power you're after.

10:36.200 --> 10:37.400
It's not power.

10:37.920 --> 10:39.080
It's safety.

10:39.960 --> 10:42.120
It's to live a good life.

10:42.330 --> 10:46.710
♪Faint rouge hides
the tenderness in the eyes♪

10:46.750 --> 10:49.860
♪Every step is treacherous,
regardless of the world♪

10:51.760 --> 10:53.520
Then, do you know who I am?

10:54.040 --> 10:55.520
Yes.

10:57.580 --> 11:00.460
♪In the palace, through dawn and dusk,
who keeps a lamp burning♪

11:00.640 --> 11:02.720
Nangong Xuanyu.

11:14.780 --> 11:19.900
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

11:21.620 --> 11:26.860
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

11:28.500 --> 11:30.860
♪If we don't meet♪

11:31.060 --> 11:34.300
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

11:34.500 --> 11:41.020
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

11:41.380 --> 11:47.820
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

11:48.180 --> 11:54.500
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

11:55.020 --> 12:01.700
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

12:01.700 --> 12:08.580
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

12:08.820 --> 12:14.700
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

12:15.620 --> 12:22.220
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

12:22.380 --> 12:29.060
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

12:29.340 --> 12:35.780
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
